{"speciesId":640,"names":{"fr":"Viridium","es":"Virizion","en":"Virizion","ja":"ビリジオン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a défié les humains pour protéger les siens. Son nom est resté dans la légende."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"This Pokémon fought humans in order to protect its friends. Legends about it continue to be passed down."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses cornes sont des lames effilées. Il lacère ses ennemis dans un mouvement tourbillonnant."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses cornes sont des lames effilées. Il lacère ses ennemis dans un mouvement tourbillonnant."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus cuernos son hojas afiladas. Sacude a sus enemigos con sus relampagueantes movimientos y los reduce."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"頭の ツノは 鋭い 刃。 旋風のような 動きで 敵を 翻弄して 素早く 切りつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il lacère ses ennemis avec une agilité sans égale. La légende raconte qu’il protège les Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que Virizion confunde a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos para proteger a otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"素早い 身のこなしで 相手を 翻弄して ポケモンを 守ると 伝説で 伝えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses cornes sont des lames effilées. Il lacère ses ennemis dans un mouvement tourbillonnant."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sus cuernos son hojas afiladas. Sacude a sus enemigos con sus relampagueantes movimientos y los reduce."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Its head sprouts horns as sharp as blades. Using whirlwind-like movements, it confounds and swiftly cuts opponents."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"頭の ツノは 鋭い 刃。 旋風のような 動きで 敵を 翻弄して 素早く 切りつける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Il lacère ses ennemis avec une agilité sans égale. La légende raconte qu’il protège les Pokémon."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cuenta la leyenda que Virizion confunde a sus rivales con rápidos movimientos para proteger a otros Pokémon."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Legends say this Pokémon confounded opponents with its swift movements."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"素早い 身のこなしで 相手を 翻弄して ポケモンを 守ると 伝説で 伝えられている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Selon la légende, il aurait combattu aux côtés de Cobaltium et de Terrakium pour protéger les Pokémon d’Unys."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Según una leyenda, luchó con valentía junto a Cobalion y Terrakion para proteger a los Pokémon de Teselia."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A legend tells of this Pokémon working together with Cobalion and Terrakion to protect the Pokémon of the Unova region."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"コバルオン テラキオンと ともに イッシュ地方の ポケモンたちを 守り続けた 伝説が 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Rapide comme le vent, il s’abat tel un tourbillon sur ses ennemis avant de les transpercer sans pitié de ses cornes acérées."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Confunde a los enemigos con sus movimientos relampagueantes y luego los rebana sin piedad con sus afilados cuernos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It darts around opponents with a flurry of quick movements, slicing them up with its horns."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"素早い 身のこなしで つむじ風の ように 敵を 翻弄し 鋭い ツノで 容赦なく 切り刻む。"}],"varieties":[{"id":640,"moves":[{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[11,"level-up",49],[11,"machine",0],[14,"level-up",49],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",49],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",49],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",37],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",37],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",56],[20,"machine",0],[25,"level-up",56],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-kick","learns":[[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",21],[25,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[11,"level-up",19],[14,"level-up",19],[15,"level-up",19],[16,"level-up",19],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",42],[25,"egg",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"roar","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"hyper-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"strength","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"solar-beam","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"quick-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[